stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> accepted: desktop_owner explicit intent
    accepted --> dispatching: engine persists dispatch marker
    accepted --> failed: engine proves unsent refusal
    dispatching --> running: engine sends target operation
    dispatching --> outcome_unknown: engine restarts without outcome proof
    running --> commit_requested: engine persists commit intent
    running --> rolled_back: target confirms rollback
    running --> completed: engine confirms complete read or export
    running --> partial: engine records import parent partial result
    running --> interrupted: engine proves readonly run interrupted
    accepted --> cancelled: engine proves operation never sent
    running --> outcome_unknown: connection loses evidence
    commit_requested --> committed: target confirms COMMIT
    commit_requested --> rolled_back: target proves rollback
    commit_requested --> outcome_unknown: reply lost
    outcome_unknown --> outcome_unknown: desktop_owner acknowledgment only
    outcome_unknown --> committed: decisive target commit evidence
    outcome_unknown --> rolled_back: decisive target rollback evidence
    committed --> [*]
    rolled_back --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    completed --> [*]
    partial --> [*]
    interrupted --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
